kes are flagged in usage_risers.basis).","IDP execution (PFR advanced defense via nflverse, ok, thru wk 11, updated 2026-11-26T12:02+00:00): on Rob's roster rows cols_idp adds tkl_share_l3 (% of his team's combined tackles), mtkl_l3 (missed tackles in each of his last 3 games, list, oldest first; null = that game not posted), mtkl_pct_l3 (missed / (missed + combined)), press_pg_l3, sacks_pg_l3, tgts_pg_l3 (times targeted in coverage), then latest-game tkl_lg, mtkl_lg, press_lg, tgts_lg. usage_risers.idp_exec = [tkl_share_l3, mtkl_pct_l3, press_pg_l3, sacks_pg_l3, tgts_pg_l3] for DL/LB/DB (null for offense). PFR posts 1-2 days after games and is often partial on Monday/Tuesday: a game without a PFR row is null (unknown), and averages use only games with a row.","Offense role & efficiency (play-by-play ok thru wk 12; PFR rec/rush ok): on Rob's roster rows cols_off adds ay_share_l3 (air-yards share %), rz_tgt_share_l3 / rz_car_share_l3 / gl_car_share_l3 (% of his team's targets and designed runs inside the 20 / carries inside the 5; scrambles, kneels and 2-pt tries excluded), rz_rush_l3 (his red-zone designed runs, total), td_l3 (rush + rec TDs, total), pa_pg_l3 (QB pass attempts; null for others), yac_pa_l3 (rush yards after contact per carry), btkl_l3 (broken tackles, total), drops_l3 (total), then rz_opps_lg (red-zone targets + carries, latest game). usage_risers.off_exec = [ay_share_l3, rz_tgt_share_l3, rz_car_share_l3, gl_car_share_l3, td_l3] for offense (null for IDP). Shares and totals use only the last-3 games already posted; a field with none is null.","usage_risers basis: 'l3' = last 3 games up 10+ pts vs the 3 before; 'spike' = latest game 15+ pts above his prior-3 average (snap % or target share); both = 'l3'. Noise floor: latest snap % >= 40, or target share >= 12% or 8+ carries that game (tuned on weeks 4-6).","vacated_roles (pool file): starters (team snap leader at RB/TE/LB/DL/DB, top 2 WR; last-3 snap % >= 60 offense / 80 defense) who are Out/Doubtful 